https://www.imaginando.pt/products/lk-ableton-live-and-midi-controller

LK turns your phone or tablet into a wireless Ableton Live controller — and a complete standalone sequencer for MIDI-compatible software.

A clip-launching grid, a step sequencer, velocity pads, a build-it-yourself control surface, an XY pad, a chord generator and an expressive keyboard — seven modules covering launching, sequencing, drumming, mixing, chords and performance.

https://www.imaginando.pt/products/bam-beat-maker-and-music-maker

BAM is a complete music production studio in the shape of a groovebox — make a beat in minutes, build a whole track⁠, anywhere.

Sixteen tracks, eleven sound engines and eleven effects, standalone or as a plugin — the same project opens identically on Mac, Windows, iPad and phone. Sketch on the couch, finish in the studio.

